DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
1::$$$message_0000_0000_0000$$$::I'm on the mountain path leading to Ryudou Temple.[lr]::
2::$$$message_0000_0000_0001$$$::The colorful fallen leaves have already been neatly brushed aside, indicating morning is over.[lr]::
3::$$$message_0000_0000_0002$$$::Today is the first day of the training camp.[lr]::
4::$$$message_0000_0000_0003$$$::Once I get to the top, a mild party atmosphere, that can only be found on peaceful days like this, will begin.::
5::$$$message_0000_0001_0000$$$::There's still plenty of time until we're supposed to meet up.[lr]::
6::$$$message_0000_0001_0001$$$::Normally, I would have gone to the temple earlier and helped them prepare for the day, but...::
7::$$$message_0000_0002_0000$$$::"No, I won't feel lonely.[lr]::
8::$$$message_0000_0002_0001$$$::You'll only be gone for two nights. Please, rest easy and leave the house to me."[lr]::
9::$$$message_0000_0002_0002$$$::"That's not what I meant. I actually want you to come, Saber."[lr]::
10::$$$message_0000_0002_0003$$$::"Then I beg your patience. You have many school friends.[lr]::
11::$$$message_0000_0002_0004$$$::I doubt there would be much for me to help with."::
12::$$$message_0000_0003_0000$$$::"Mrgh. Would it bother you that much to meet them?"[lr]::
13::$$$message_0000_0003_0001$$$::"'Bother' might be putting it strongly...[lr]::
14::$$$message_0000_0003_0002$$$::During the camp, you'll be focused on taking care of your friends. I wouldn't want you to concern yourself with an outsider like me on top of that."::
15::$$$message_0000_0004_0000$$$::"It's not like that, Saber. Nobody thinks of you as an outsider. Plus, the people going aren't my friends so much as..."[lr]::
16::$$$message_0000_0004_0001$$$::My enemies.[lr]::
17::$$$message_0000_0004_0002$$$::But if I say that, Saber might literally cut Makidera in half.::
18::$$$message_0000_0005_0000$$$::"Oh, um.[lr]::
19::$$$message_0000_0005_0001$$$::I mean, they're friends that you don't have to worry about.[lr]::
20::$$$message_0000_0005_0002$$$::We planned this on short notice, so we could use the help. Makidera's group said they'd ask someone they know, too."[lr]::
21::$$$message_0000_0005_0003$$$::"Be that as it may...[lr]::
22::$$$message_0000_0005_0004$$$::What would I do while everyone else is practicing?"::
23::$$$message_0000_0006_0000$$$::"W-well..."[lr]::
24::$$$message_0000_0006_0001$$$::...Oof.[lr]::
25::$$$message_0000_0006_0002$$$::I knew it. Tohsaka didn't tell her anything.[lr]::
26::$$$message_0000_0006_0003$$$::Argh, how did we get involved with this funny business to begin with?::
27::$$$message_0000_0007_0000$$$::This is more than a typical sports training camp.[lr]::
28::$$$message_0000_0007_0001$$$::It's a joint event between the kyudo and track clubs, and on top of that...[lr]::
29::$$$message_0000_0007_0002$$$::"...Actually, we want you to get on stage.[lr]::
30::$$$message_0000_0007_0003$$$::It's Tohsaka's idea."[lr]::
31::$$$message_0000_0007_0004$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
32::$$$message_0000_0007_0005$$$::"I-in a play!? Me!?"::
33::$$$message_0000_0008_0000$$$::That's right. This camp is going to be a rehearsal of the play we plan to perform at the cultural festival.[lr]::
34::$$$message_0000_0008_0001$$$::Saber's right to be astonished.[lr]::
35::$$$message_0000_0008_0002$$$::The devil alone knows how we got mixed-up this deeply.[lr]::
36::$$$message_0000_0008_0003$$$::"Are you serious, Shirou?"[lr]::
37::$$$message_0000_0008_0004$$$::"Well... I won't force you to do it..."::
38::$$$message_0000_0009_0000$$$::"But it would make me happy if you do. The kyudo club would really appreciate it, too."[lr]::
39::$$$message_0000_0009_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
40::$$$message_0000_0009_0002$$$::"...Are you amusing yourself at my expense, Shirou?"[lr]::
41::$$$message_0000_0009_0003$$$::"Sorry. I'd be lying if I said I wasn't looking forward to it."::
42::$$$message_0000_0010_0000$$$::"I appreciate your honesty. Have a good trip."[lr]::
43::$$$message_0000_0010_0001$$$::"Hey!"::
44::$$$message_0000_0011_0000$$$::"No need to worry about my meals! I've already planned it all out: [wvl]sushi, [wvl canskip=0 time=400]pizza, [wvl canskip=0 time=400]and tempura bowls!"[lr]::
45::$$$message_0000_0011_0001$$$::"That's way too much junk food, Saber!"::
46::$$$message_0000_0012_0000$$$::I'm at my wits' end.[lr]::
47::$$$message_0000_0012_0001$$$::In the end, Saber stubbornly kicked me out of the house.[lr]::
48::$$$message_0000_0012_0002$$$::When I get back from camp, I am [font italic=true]not[font italic=false] looking forward to seeing the delicately balanced mountain of take-out and delivery boxes piled outside the front door.::
49::$$$message_0000_0013_0000$$$::...Well, there's Fuji-nee. She'll probably come check on Saber if she's home alone.[lr]::
50::$$$message_0000_0013_0001$$$::I don't have to worry about burglars, at least... But we've already gotten off on the wrong foot.::
51::$$$message_0000_0014_0000$$$::"Good morning."[lr]::
52::$$$message_0000_0014_0001$$$::I greet Mr. Kuzuki on the way to the green room.[lr]::
53::$$$message_0000_0014_0002$$$::"Good morning."[lr]::
54::$$$message_0000_0014_0003$$$::"Oh. Welcome, young Emiya."[lr]::
55::$$$message_0000_0014_0004$$$::Caster beams at me from around Kuzuki's shoulder.::
56::$$$message_0000_0015_0000$$$::...On second glance, her eyes aren't smiling.[lr]::
57::$$$message_0000_0015_0001$$$::She's looking at me like a trespasser, or a cockroach.[lr]::
58::$$$message_0000_0015_0002$$$::Maybe she thinks we're spoiling her weekend with Mr. Kuzuki.::
59::$$$message_0000_0016_0000$$$::"You should hurry. Several others are already here."[lr]::
60::$$$message_0000_0016_0001$$$::"Yes, sir. Thank you for hosting us."[lr]::
61::$$$message_0000_0016_0002$$$::"Mm."[lr]::
62::$$$message_0000_0016_0003$$$::"Are you going out today, Souichirou?"::
63::$$$message_0000_0017_0000$$$::"No, I don't have any business outside.[lr]::
64::$$$message_0000_0017_0001$$$::Reikan did invite me for a round of Go, though."[lr]::
65::$$$message_0000_0017_0002$$$::"I see..."[lr]::
66::$$$message_0000_0017_0003$$$::"What is it?"[lr]::
67::$$$message_0000_0017_0004$$$::"I was hoping to stock up for the winter, but it would involve a lot of shopping..."[lr]::
68::$$$message_0000_0017_0005$$$::"...Hm. Someone should help you carry things. I'll let Reikan know that I'll be late."::
69::$$$message_0000_0018_0000$$$::"Y-yes. I'll get ready right away!"[lr]::
70::$$$message_0000_0018_0001$$$::Mr. Kuzuki nods, and Caster cheerfully trots off to their room.::
71::$$$message_0000_0019_0000$$$::"Until later, then. I'm sure we'll be seeing more of each other."[lr]::
72::$$$message_0000_0019_0001$$$::I bow and see him off.[lr]::
73::$$$message_0000_0019_0002$$$::He's as stiff as ever, whether in the workplace or at home.[lr]::
74::$$$message_0000_0019_0003$$$::And Caster's newlywed act is as forced as ever.::
75::$$$message_0000_0020_0000$$$::"Morning. Sorry I'm late."[lr]::
76::$$$message_0000_0020_0001$$$::"Oh, Emiya. Morning[line len=2]ngh."[lr]::
77::$$$message_0000_0020_0002$$$::"Hm. You're late, Emiya."[lr]::
78::$$$message_0000_0020_0003$$$::"Good morning, Senpai."::
79::$$$message_0000_0021_0000$$$::"...Um, what are you doing?"[lr]::
80::$$$message_0000_0021_0001$$$::Mitsuzuri is spread-eagle on the floor in the middle of the room.::
81::$$$message_0000_0022_0000$$$::"...Having fun so early in the morning, Mitsuzuri?"[lr]::
82::$$$message_0000_0022_0001$$$::"Yeah. Rich temples sure are something else.[lr]::
83::$$$message_0000_0022_0002$$$::You see this tatami flooring? It's all freshly cut. Any real Japanese person would want to roll on them.[lr]::
84::$$$message_0000_0022_0003$$$::Must be nice. I bet Ryudou did this yesterday."[lr]::
85::$$$message_0000_0022_0004$$$::"As if! I am not a zoo panda!"::
86::$$$message_0000_0023_0000$$$::"Sure, okay. We'll just enjoy this without you.[lr]::
87::$$$message_0000_0023_0001$$$::C'mon, Matou, join me! It feels really good!"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
88::$$$message_0000_0023_0002$$$::"I-I think I'm okay... Mitsuzuri-senpai, this is a temple, you know..."::
89::$$$message_0000_0024_0000$$$::"Mmm, the aroma of fresh-cut grass![wvs][shock vmax=15 time=800 count=4][se storage=se040.wav][lr]::
90::$$$message_0000_0024_0001$$$::I claim this banquet hall in the name of the kyudo club!"[lr]::
91::$$$message_0000_0024_0002$$$::Roll. Tumble. Mitsuzuri's sure in a great mood.::
92::$$$message_0000_0025_0000$$$::"Mitsuzuri, you should listen to Matou. This is neither a banquet hall nor a lobby. It's a lecture hall, to be precise.[lr]::
93::$$$message_0000_0025_0001$$$::Here, the Lotus Sutra is recited day and night. In other words, it's a place for learning Buddhist morals, making it a school.[lr]::
94::$$$message_0000_0025_0002$$$::While this may be a training camp, I ask that you conduct yourself with[line len=2]"[lr]::
95::$$$message_0000_0025_0003$$$::"Look, look! Spread eagle reverse somersault!"[lr]::
96::$$$message_0000_0025_0004$$$::Sakura watches Mitsuzuri's gymnastics with a mixture of worry and amazement.::
97::$$$message_0000_0026_0000$$$::"...Emiya, do something about this feral panda."[lr]::
98::$$$message_0000_0026_0001$$$::"Just let her be, she's having fun. We've done that before, too."::
99::$$$message_0000_0027_0000$$$::"What year exactly are you referring to?"[lr]::
100::$$$message_0000_0027_0001$$$::"Hahaha. You broke the door, but I got in trouble for it."[lr]::
101::$$$message_0000_0027_0002$$$::"Wha...!?"[lr]::
102::$$$message_0000_0027_0003$$$::"Hehe."::
103::$$$message_0000_0028_0000$$$::"G-good morning, everyone!"[lr]::
104::$$$message_0000_0028_0001$$$::"Thanks for having us."[lr]::
105::$$$message_0000_0028_0002$$$::"W-WHOOOOA IT'S HUGE![lr]::
106::$$$message_0000_0028_0003$$$::I-is this the legendary thousand-tatami hall!?"[lr]::
107::$$$message_0000_0028_0004$$$::"Maki?"::
108::$$$message_0000_0029_0000$$$::"Check this out, flying front flip!"[lr]::
109::$$$message_0000_0029_0001$$$::With a running start, Makidera dives into the sea of tatami. She twists her body from a front flip into a graceful back roll.[lr]::
110::$$$message_0000_0029_0002$$$::"M-Maki, you shouldn't!"[lr]::
111::$$$message_0000_0029_0003$$$::"She's the type to swim in an open-air bath. Nothing we can do."::
112::$$$message_0000_0030_0000$$$::Issei pokes my shoulder.[lr]::
113::$$$message_0000_0030_0001$$$::"Emiya. How can you stand it? They're going to be here for two whole days. I am very worr[line len=2]no, I'm terrified."[lr]::
114::$$$message_0000_0030_0002$$$::"...Yeah. It's no laughing matter.[lr]::
115::$$$message_0000_0030_0003$$$::I'm sure I'm gonna get in trouble again."::
116::$$$message_0000_0031_0000$$$::Issei clutches his head [shock vmax=25 time=600 count=-5][se storage=se040.wav]next to me.[lr]::
117::$$$message_0000_0031_0001$$$::Makidera does a loud belly flop into the center of the room, then she rolls onto her back and flexes her bicep.[lr]::
118::$$$message_0000_0031_0002$$$::"Did you see that!? It was the moonsault that Rob Van Dam gave up his ACL to pull off!"::
119::$$$message_0000_0032_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
120::$$$message_0000_0032_0001$$$::Mitsuzuri is watching coldly, arms folded. When did she get there?::
121::$$$message_0000_0033_0000$$$::"Urgh... [wvl canskip=0 time=300]Mitsuzuri!"[lr]::
122::$$$message_0000_0033_0001$$$::"...Ha. Can't believe you'd get so worked up over this..."[lr]::
123::$$$message_0000_0033_0002$$$::"Sh-she's looking down on me![lr]::
124::$$$message_0000_0033_0003$$$::This woman, of all people, is looking down on me!"[lr]::
125::$$$message_0000_0033_0004$$$::"..."[lr]::
126::$$$message_0000_0033_0005$$$::I wish I could point it out.[lr]::
127::$$$message_0000_0033_0006$$$::She's acting all high-and-mighty now, but I want to expose her for doing the exact same thing a moment ago!::
128::$$$message_0000_0034_0000$$$::"Well, what was I expecting? They say that this is what happens when someone has a repressed childhood."[lr]::
129::$$$message_0000_0034_0001$$$::"Keeeeeee! You mega jerk! I've always been this way!"[lr]::
130::$$$message_0000_0034_0002$$$::"Makino-G. Quit while you're ahead. We can't back you up this time."[lr]::
131::$$$message_0000_0034_0003$$$::"Yes, ma'am."::
132::$$$message_0000_0035_0000$$$::"Enough![lr]::
133::$$$message_0000_0035_0001$$$::Is this everyone? If so, I'll call my brother. We have something to discuss first."[lr]::
134::$$$message_0000_0035_0002$$$::"Tohsaka's not here yet."[lr]::
135::$$$message_0000_0035_0003$$$::"That's fine. Hold on a minute."::
136::$$$message_0000_0036_0000$$$::Issei vanishes from the lecture hall, leaving me as the only male in the room.[lr]::
137::$$$message_0000_0036_0001$$$::...He's obviously on edge.[lr]::
138::$$$message_0000_0036_0002$$$::It's only to be expected when this many girls are around... In fact, I'm a little frightened at how coolly I'm handling this gender ratio.::
139::$$$message_0000_0037_0000$$$::"Senpai, um..."[lr]::
140::$$$message_0000_0037_0001$$$::"Sakura, have you heard from Tohsaka? Is she late even though this was her idea?"[lr]::
141::$$$message_0000_0037_0002$$$::"I heard she pulled an all-nighter."[lr]::
142::$$$message_0000_0037_0003$$$::"An all-nighter... Don't tell me she went straight back to that haunted house and stayed up turning her library over for reference materials?"[lr]::
143::$$$message_0000_0037_0004$$$::"Yeah."::
144::$$$message_0000_0038_0000$$$::"Yup. I'm pretty sleepy too, actually."[lr]::
145::$$$message_0000_0038_0001$$$::Mitsuzuri yawns theatrically.[lr]::
146::$$$message_0000_0038_0002$$$::"...Did [font italic=true]anyone[font italic=false] get any sleep?"[lr]::
147::$$$message_0000_0038_0003$$$::"Oh, me too. I got a fax as long as a freakin' anaconda!"[lr]::
148::$$$message_0000_0038_0004$$$::A [font italic=true]fax!?[font italic=false] When the heck did she buy a fax machine!?[lr]::
149::$$$message_0000_0038_0005$$$::Talk about casting pearls before swine. Dollars before panthers. Sailor uniforms before Fuji-nee.::
150::$$$message_0000_0039_0000$$$::"Um... I got the message late last night, too.[lr]::
151::$$$message_0000_0039_0001$$$::It was Miss Tohsaka's handwritten script. She asked me to skim it."[lr]::
152::$$$message_0000_0039_0002$$$::"A script... I thought she said she was going to look for a pre-made one that fits. When did she go and write it herself?"::
153::$$$message_0000_0040_0000$$$::"Didn't she send a beep-beep-beep over to your house?"[lr]::
154::$$$message_0000_0040_0001$$$::"What beep-beep-beep? We don't own a fax machine."[lr]::
155::$$$message_0000_0040_0002$$$::"Then you must have gotten a good night's sleep."[lr]::
156::$$$message_0000_0040_0003$$$::Just then, I notice that Saegusa's eyes are bloodshot behind her merry smile.[lr]::
157::$$$message_0000_0040_0004$$$::It's much more comforting than Caster's barely-disguised sarcasm, yet somehow menacing all the same.::
158::$$$message_0000_0041_0000$$$::"I just wish she'd sent the pages starting from the beginning so I could read it as it came in."[lr]::
159::$$$message_0000_0041_0001$$$::"Hold up, she sent it starting from the last page?[lr]::
160::$$$message_0000_0041_0002$$$::...No wonder I couldn't make heads or tails of it..."[lr]::
161::$$$message_0000_0041_0003$$$::"What? So how did she send it, exactly?"::
162::$$$message_0000_0042_0000$$$::"I received the script, too...[cacheimage storage=氷室私服01b(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=氷室私服01b(遠) textoff=0] It was just an endless stream of blank pages, however."[lr]::
163::$$$message_0000_0042_0001$$$::"She faxed the pages to you upside-down, huh... Sounds like her."[lr]::
164::$$$message_0000_0042_0002$$$::"Breaking News: Snow-White Anaconda Spotted at Midnight!"[lr]::
165::$$$message_0000_0042_0003$$$::"When I had her resend it, the last pages were completely faded."[lr]::
166::$$$message_0000_0042_0004$$$::An image comes to mind of Tohsaka timidly fiddling with a brand-new fax machine until she loses her temper.::
167::$$$message_0000_0043_0000$$$::"I told her she could've just send it as an e-mail."[lr]::
168::$$$message_0000_0043_0001$$$::"That would probably have taken her three times longer."[lr]::
169::$$$message_0000_0043_0002$$$::"Enough with the Tohsaka slander. More like five times longer."[lr]::
170::$$$message_0000_0043_0003$$$::"...I think e-mail would be asking the impossible."::
171::$$$message_0000_0044_0000$$$::"So she sent it to you last, Kane.[lr]::
172::$$$message_0000_0044_0001$$$::Did you manage to get any sleep?"[lr]::
173::$$$message_0000_0044_0002$$$::"Almost none at all. Feels like I could pass out any second."[lr]::
174::$$$message_0000_0044_0003$$$::"You don't look any different, though."[lr]::
175::$$$message_0000_0044_0004$$$::Mitsuzuri tries her cell phone.::
176::$$$message_0000_0045_0000$$$::"...She's not picking up at home. Is she still asleep?"[lr]::
177::$$$message_0000_0045_0001$$$::"Say whaaat!?"[lr]::
178::$$$message_0000_0045_0002$$$::"Shall I go retrieve her, just in case?"[lr]::
179::$$$message_0000_0045_0003$$$::"Oh, surWHOOOOA!?"[lr]::
180::$$$message_0000_0045_0004$$$::Wow, Mitsuzuri just did a reverse dash into the wall.::
181::$$$message_0000_0046_0000$$$::"Ah, I'm sorry, Mitsuzuri-senpai.[lr]::
182::$$$message_0000_0046_0001$$$::There wasn't a good time to introduce you..."[lr]::
183::$$$message_0000_0046_0002$$$::"You came too, Rider?"[lr]::
184::$$$message_0000_0046_0003$$$::"How[line len=2][wvl canskip=0 time=400]when[line len=2][wm canskip=0][wvl][move time=140 path=(655,143,255)(649,132,255)(660,155,255)(649,132,255) storage=美綴私服02h(遠) accel=0 textoff=0]when did you get here, Rider!?"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
185::$$$message_0000_0046_0004$$$::Temples twitching, Mitsuzuri makes a pose like a giant of light facing off against a monster from outer space.::
186::$$$message_0000_0047_0000$$$::"I've been here with Sakura the entire time. You just failed to notice me."[lr]::
187::$$$message_0000_0047_0001$$$::"L-[wvl canskip=0 time=400]liar, [wvl canskip=0 time=200]you're lying! [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=4]Where were you hiding!?"[lr]::
188::$$$message_0000_0047_0002$$$::"I was captivated by your frolicking on the floor."[lr]::
189::$$$message_0000_0047_0003$$$::"You had a front-row seat!?"[lr]::
190::$$$message_0000_0047_0004$$$::...She must have been in spirit form.::
191::$$$message_0000_0048_0000$$$::"Who's this Rider person?"[lr]::
192::$$$message_0000_0048_0001$$$::"I'm sorry, Makidera-senpai. I'll introduce her to everyone later. [cacheimage storage=桜私服10g(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服10g(中)]Rider, would you mind reaching out to Tohsaka-senpai?"[lr]::
193::$$$message_0000_0048_0002$$$::"Very well."[lr]::
194::$$$message_0000_0048_0003$$$::She glances at me, as if for confirmation.[lr]::
195::$$$message_0000_0048_0004$$$::"Please, Rider. We can't start until Tohsaka gets here."[lr]::
196::$$$message_0000_0048_0005$$$::"That's reasonable, of course, but..."[lr]::
197::$$$message_0000_0048_0006$$$::"Huh?"::
198::$$$message_0000_0049_0000$$$::"Are you sure you don't want to call Saber, too?"[lr]::
199::$$$message_0000_0049_0001$$$::"Urgh..."[lr]::
200::$$$message_0000_0049_0002$$$::"I assumed she would be here with you..."[lr]::
201::$$$message_0000_0049_0003$$$::"That was the plan, but she turned me down."[lr]::
202::$$$message_0000_0049_0004$$$::"Huh? So she's going to be home alone tonight?"[lr]::
203::$$$message_0000_0049_0005$$$::"Apparently."::
204::$$$message_0000_0050_0000$$$::"What? You should ask her to come. She's so pretty, I don't feel great about leaving her out."[lr]::
205::$$$message_0000_0050_0001$$$::"You're taking this well. You're always like that, aren't you, Mitsuzuri."[lr]::
206::$$$message_0000_0050_0002$$$::"I mean, she was going to be on Team Kyudo Club, right?"[lr]::
207::$$$message_0000_0050_0003$$$::"...Already got it all planned out, huh?"[lr]::
208::$$$message_0000_0050_0004$$$::"What's that!? You called backup!? [cacheimage storage=蒔寺私服02c(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服02c(遠) textoff=0]Bring it on!"[lr]::
209::$$$message_0000_0050_0005$$$::"You're taking this pretty well too, Makidera."::
210::$$$message_0000_0051_0000$$$::"You've got me too, Ayako."[lr]::
211::$$$message_0000_0051_0001$$$::With a jolt, Mitsuzuri jumps, as if struck by lightning.::
212::$$$message_0000_0052_0000$$$::"Th-thank you![lr]::
213::$$$message_0000_0052_0001$$$::B-but no more sneaking up on us and whispering in our ears! This is sacred ground, you know!"[lr]::
214::$$$message_0000_0052_0002$$$::If Issei heard that, he'd weep and give you a sermon.::
215::$$$message_0000_0053_0000$$$::"Club teams aside...[lr]::
216::$$$message_0000_0053_0001$$$::Rider, I'd like you to try inviting Saber again. Sorry for all the trouble."[lr]::
217::$$$message_0000_0053_0002$$$::"Yes, I'll try.[lr]::
218::$$$message_0000_0053_0003$$$::I'll see you all again shortly."::
219::$$$message_0000_0054_0000$$$::"Whew. Rider really came through at the eleventh hour."[lr]::
220::$$$message_0000_0054_0001$$$::"I hope that's all she does..."[lr]::
221::$$$message_0000_0054_0002$$$::Sakura murmurs something, watching Mitsuzuri slump down to the floor. She's relieved...I think.::
222::$$$message_0000_0055_0000$$$::"Thanks for waiting. Is everyone here yet?"[lr]::
223::$$$message_0000_0055_0001$$$::Issei replaces Rider.[lr]::
224::$$$message_0000_0055_0002$$$::He's accompanied by a man in traditional monk daily wear.[lr]::
225::$$$message_0000_0055_0003$$$::This tall, broad-shouldered man, built like a cypress tree, is none other than Issei's oldest brother, and the temple's day-to-day leader.::
226::$$$message_0000_0056_0000$$$::"Good morning."[lr]::
227::$$$message_0000_0056_0001$$$::[line len=3]Good morning![lr]::
228::$$$message_0000_0056_0002$$$::We all stand up straight and line up, greeting Reikan in unison. It's practically instinct for anyone in a sports club.[lr]::
229::$$$message_0000_0056_0003$$$::If anyone was still half-asleep, we're all wide awake now.::
230::$$$message_0000_0057_0000$$$::"Good to see you all bright-eyed and bushy-tailed.[lr]::
231::$$$message_0000_0057_0001$$$::My name is Reikan, and I'm in charge of Ryudou Temple when the head monk is absent. You write it with the same characters you'd use in 'zero' and 'stargazing.'[lr]::
232::$$$message_0000_0057_0002$$$::I actually graduated from Homurahara too, so we have that in common."[lr]::
233::$$$message_0000_0057_0003$$$::Reikan and Mitsuzuri make eye contact and slightly bow in greeting.::
234::$$$message_0000_0058_0000$$$::"Now, I'm told that the kyudo and track & field clubs are both part of this training camp. Is everyone here?"[lr]::
235::$$$message_0000_0058_0001$$$::At school, Issei would answer that question, but he seems to be taking a step back right now.[lr]::
236::$$$message_0000_0058_0002$$$::I answer on behalf of the group.::
237::$$$message_0000_0059_0000$$$::"Sorry, we're still missing one person.[lr]::
238::$$$message_0000_0059_0001$$$::We also have a few members who are not students."[lr]::
239::$$$message_0000_0059_0002$$$::"Oh, I see. So they'll be showing up soon?[lr]::
240::$$$message_0000_0059_0003$$$::Do fill me in on the details later. I'd like to know more about this motley bunch."::
241::$$$message_0000_0060_0000$$$::"I'll begin with some background about this temple.[lr]::
242::$$$message_0000_0060_0001$$$::I'd appreciate it if you catch up the latecomers when they get here."[lr]::
243::$$$message_0000_0060_0002$$$::The acting temple head gives us a summary of Ryudou Temple's history and its connection to Homurahara High.[lr]::
244::$$$message_0000_0060_0003$$$::His resounding voice fills the lecture hall.::
245::$$$message_0000_0061_0000$$$::"There are usually a large number of young monks living at the temple, but they recently left on a trip with the head monk.[lr]::
246::$$$message_0000_0061_0001$$$::May they return home with life and limbs intact. But if they don't, we're lucky to have the fine students of Homurahara livening these spacious halls. Mm, I couldn't have calculated it better myself."[lr]::
247::$$$message_0000_0061_0002$$$::Between his sunny tone and his ominous words, I can't tell if Reikan's joking.::
248::$$$message_0000_0062_0000$$$::"Feel free to make use of this hall and the attached living quarters. The rooms are separated by gender, of course."::
249::$$$message_0000_0063_0000$$$::"I'm told that you'll be rehearsing a play.[lr]::
250::$$$message_0000_0063_0001$$$::I'm so pleased to hear that. If one of you eventually becomes a star actor, the temple gift shop's sales will go through the roof."[lr]::
251::$$$message_0000_0063_0002$$$::Everyone shakes their heads modestly.[lr]::
252::$$$message_0000_0063_0003$$$::...Except for Mitsuzuri, who seems to be giving it serious thought.::
253::$$$message_0000_0064_0000$$$::"I expect royalties."[lr]::
254::$$$message_0000_0064_0001$$$::"Huh? [cacheimage storage=蒔寺私服01g(中),美綴私服02a(中),蒔寺私服04a(中)][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服01g(中),美綴私服02a(中) textoff=0]Oh. [cacheimage storage=蒔寺私服04a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服04a(中) textoff=0][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=4]Me too!"::
255::$$$message_0000_0065_0000$$$::"...My brother is joking. We don't sell charms here, to begin with."[lr]::
256::$$$message_0000_0065_0001$$$::"Now now, Issei. I'm sure Caster could whip up a hundred or two if we asked.[lr]::
257::$$$message_0000_0065_0002$$$::That's something to look forward to.[lr]::
258::$$$message_0000_0065_0003$$$::We'll also relax our lights-out policy since you're here for the camp."::
259::$$$message_0000_0066_0000$$$::"In exchange, tomorrow morning I would like you all to help clean the walkways behind the temple for about one hour. Think of it as volunteer work.[lr]::
260::$$$message_0000_0066_0001$$$::Mister Emiya and Miss Mitsuzuri know what to do, so I'll let them instruct you."::
261::$$$message_0000_0067_0000$$$::"I mentioned that we've set aside some rooms for you to use,[lr]::
262::$$$message_0000_0067_0001$$$::but feel free to explore the rest of the temple if you're curious."::
263::$$$message_0000_0068_0000$$$::"However, the western building contains the living quarters of the head monk, as well as me and Issei.[lr]::
264::$$$message_0000_0068_0001$$$::Mr. Kuzuki and his wife also make their love nest in the furthest part of that building, so I ask that you not go out there without a specific need.[lr]::
265::$$$message_0000_0068_0002$$$::The Buddha may punish you otherwise."[lr]::
266::$$$message_0000_0068_0003$$$::Reikan finishes his enthusiastic introduction, and we bow as he leaves.::
267::$$$message_0000_0069_0000$$$::"...Whew. It's over."[lr]::
268::$$$message_0000_0069_0001$$$::"What are you so nervous for, Issei? That's just Reikan being Reikan."[lr]::
269::$$$message_0000_0069_0002$$$::"Indeed. As you can see, he's a passionate man.[lr]::
270::$$$message_0000_0069_0003$$$::I try to be calm and collected, but I've sworn to become a more broad-minded individual like Souichirou or Reikan."[lr]::
271::$$$message_0000_0069_0004$$$::To Issei, Reikan is more of a role model than a sibling.::
272::$$$message_0000_0070_0000$$$::"That aside, is Tohsaka here yet?"[lr]::
273::$$$message_0000_0070_0001$$$::"I'll try her phone again."[lr]::
274::$$$message_0000_0070_0002$$$::Mitsuzuri takes out her cell phone.[lr]::
275::$$$message_0000_0070_0003$$$::"Hey! No phones on temple grounds."[lr]::
276::$$$message_0000_0070_0004$$$::"Aw, c'mon. You guys ban puns like they're fine wine."[lr]::
277::$$$message_0000_0070_0005$$$::"This is no pun, fool![lr]::
278::$$$message_0000_0070_0006$$$::First of all, even an oni wouldn't bring itself to do that!"::
279::$$$message_0000_0071_0000$$$::"That should do it."[lr]::
280::$$$message_0000_0071_0001$$$::There wasn't much litter to clean up on the paths behind Ryudou Temple.[lr]::
281::$$$message_0000_0071_0002$$$::Our work amounted to moving rocks out of the way or shoveling leaves into compost piles for the temple gardens.[lr]::
282::$$$message_0000_0071_0003$$$::Job finished, my team[line len=2]Sakura and Mitsuzuri[line len=2]starts on the path down the mountain.::
283::$$$message_0000_0072_0000$$$::Just before we reach the side gate to the temple, I hear the voices of the track & field trio beyond the mortar wall...especially Makidera's.[lr]::
284::$$$message_0000_0072_0001$$$::They were assigned to clean the area around the temple itself, and they seem to be having an argument.[sestop time=3000 nowait=1][lr]::
285::$$$message_0000_0072_0002$$$::They're arguing with...Tohsaka, I think.::
286::$$$message_0000_0073_0000$$$::"I apologized, didn't I?"[lr]::
287::$$$message_0000_0073_0001$$$::"Nope, I don't forgive you! [wvl canskip=0 time=500]Gotta take this chance to get my hits in while I can![lr]::
288::$$$message_0000_0073_0002$$$::We're not at school, so no playing goody-two-shoes. I want you to apologize as the freewheeling Tohsaka who goes shopping with me!"[lr]::
289::$$$message_0000_0073_0003$$$::"...This is the problem with morning people.[lr]::
290::$$$message_0000_0073_0004$$$::So what, you want me to make it up to you by cleaning the whole place by myself tomorrow?"::
291::$$$message_0000_0074_0000$$$::"What's going on?"[lr]::
292::$$$message_0000_0074_0001$$$::"Ah...morning."[lr]::
293::$$$message_0000_0074_0002$$$::Tohsaka greets me and shrugs.[lr]::
294::$$$message_0000_0074_0003$$$::She doesn't look like she overslept. I wonder how Makidera will deal with this.[lr]::
295::$$$message_0000_0074_0004$$$::Makidera responds to my intervention in an unexpected way.::
296::$$$message_0000_0075_0000$$$::"Nah, I don't care enough to make you clean or anything."[lr]::
297::$$$message_0000_0075_0001$$$::"Eh?"[lr]::
298::$$$message_0000_0075_0002$$$::"You sure sound like you care, Maki."[lr]::
299::$$$message_0000_0075_0003$$$::"Yes, ma'am."[lr]::
300::$$$message_0000_0075_0004$$$::"If you're not mad that I'm late, then what's the issue?"[lr]::
301::$$$message_0000_0075_0005$$$::Makidera, temporarily cowed by Saegusa, instantly explodes.[lr]::
302::$$$message_0000_0075_0006$$$::"Whoa whoa whoa! You still don't know?"[lr]::
303::$$$message_0000_0075_0007$$$::"Keep it down, Makino-G."::
304::$$$message_0000_0076_0000$$$::"Rraaaagh! Who wouldn't be pissed off!?"[lr]::
305::$$$message_0000_0076_0001$$$::Makidera gesticulates with her rolled-up copy of the fax, [fadein time=100 storage=white textoff=0][rep textoff=0 fliplr=0 tops=71,58,44,38 storages=由紀香私服01d(中),氷室私服01d(中),凛私服03f(中),蒔寺私服02b(中) time=200 flipud=0 lefts=-34,320,393,30 bg=o柳洞寺_裏(秋)-(昼) indexes=1000,2000,3000,4000][shock vmax=30 time=500 count=5]clapping it with her hand. That must be the script.[lr]::
306::$$$message_0000_0076_0002$$$::"Look at [font italic=true]this![font italic=false] [wvl][lquake vmax=5 hmax=5 storage=蒔寺私服パンチ02a(中)]What's the big idea, giving me the Monkey role!?[wvl canskip=0 time=800][stoplquake layer=all][wait canskip=0 time=400][se storage=se106.wav][shock vmax=30 time=500 count=5] HUH!?"[lr]::
307::$$$message_0000_0076_0003$$$::Monkey? ...Oh, she's mad about the casting.::
308::$$$message_0000_0077_0000$$$::"Oh, that.[lr]::
309::$$$message_0000_0077_0001$$$::Well, Miss Makidera, you look confident in your monkey impressions."[lr]::
310::$$$message_0000_0077_0002$$$::"Yeeeek! What's [font italic=true]that[font italic=false] supposed to mean!?"[lr]::
311::$$$message_0000_0077_0003$$$::"Yup, Okay. You pass."[lr]::
312::$$$message_0000_0077_0004$$$::"Wha... [cacheimage storage=蒔寺私服04b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服04b(中) textoff=0]I made it through the first round of auditions without even trying!?"::
313::$$$message_0000_0078_0000$$$::"Yeah, I have to admit that you'd be the best for the role. You've got my stamp of approval."[lr]::
314::$$$message_0000_0078_0001$$$::"Ergh. Thanks.[lr]::
315::$$$message_0000_0078_0002$$$::...Wait, no. Who d'ya think you are, Tohsaka!?"[lr]::
316::$$$message_0000_0078_0003$$$::"That's [cacheimage storage=凛私服04c眼鏡(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][clfg][fg left=223 index=1000 top=17 storage=凛私服04c眼鏡(近)][dash storage=o柳洞寺_裏(秋)-(昼) page=back textoff=0 mx=-179 opacity=255 layer=all irot=-0.0 cx=626 imag=1.3 time=30 cy=300 mag=1.3 my=0 rot=-0.0 accel=0][transex time=300 textoff=0][font italic=true]Director[font italic=false] Tohsaka to you."[lr]::
317::$$$message_0000_0078_0004$$$::She smiles. She even put on glasses. Today, she's an absolute aristocrat.::
318::$$$message_0000_0079_0000$$$::"For real!? [wvl canskip=0 time=400]Oh no, we can't win, she's the strongest in the world![lr]::
319::$$$message_0000_0079_0001$$$::All it takes is one director's touch to make a script unrecognizable, like turning Godzilla into Devilman!"[lr]::
320::$$$message_0000_0079_0002$$$::"Actually, Makidera-senpai?[lr]::
321::$$$message_0000_0079_0003$$$::We haven't decided who the director will be yet. Though we did ask Tohsaka-senpai to handle the script."[lr]::
322::$$$message_0000_0079_0004$$$::"Yeah. There might be other candidates for the job."::
323::$$$message_0000_0080_0000$$$::"Really? [wvl canskip=0 time=300]I just assumed I'd be in charge."[lr]::
324::$$$message_0000_0080_0001$$$::Tohsaka doesn't miss a beat. Where does she get that confidence?[lr]::
325::$$$message_0000_0080_0002$$$::"Um, I'm the Dog. What about you, Kane?"[lr]::
326::$$$message_0000_0080_0003$$$::"The Pheasant.[lr]::
327::$$$message_0000_0080_0004$$$::I have no objections to my casting.[lr]::
328::$$$message_0000_0080_0005$$$::But I'm slightly concerned about some unclear plot developments."::
329::$$$message_0000_0081_0000$$$::Still... Dog, Monkey, and Pheasant only leaves one possibility. Did Tohsaka send a script of [font italic=true]Momotarou[font italic=false] to everyone? Hmm... That feels a little unoriginal for her...::
330::$$$message_0000_0082_0000$$$::"Never mind that. You can't keep arguing out here. If we're done cleaning, we should put away our tools and go back to the hall. You can pick this up there."::
331::$$$message_0000_0083_0000$$$::"Oh, the other helpers already went on ahead.[lr]::
332::$$$message_0000_0083_0001$$$::Ryudou's dealing with them now."[lr]::
333::$$$message_0000_0083_0002$$$::"Huh? You brought Saber with you?"[lr]::
334::$$$message_0000_0083_0003$$$::My voice comes out happier than I expected.[lr]::
335::$$$message_0000_0083_0004$$$::"Yeah. That too."[lr]::
336::$$$message_0000_0083_0005$$$::"W-what?"[lr]::
337::$$$message_0000_0083_0006$$$::Tohsaka just snickered. It was a devilish laugh for and by a devil.::
338::$$$message_0000_0084_0000$$$::"Things are getting interesting, that's all."[lr]::
339::$$$message_0000_0084_0001$$$::Her wicked aura is growing so much I can almost taste it.[lr]::
340::$$$message_0000_0084_0002$$$::...Plural "helpers"? "Things are getting interesting"?::
341::$$$message_0000_0085_0000$$$::"What the..."[lr]::
342::$$$message_0000_0085_0001$$$::I don't know what magic spell she used, but the hall is filled with familiar faces.::
343::$$$message_0000_0086_0000$$$::Sakura and I are gaping.[lr]::
344::$$$message_0000_0086_0001$$$::Lancer's with the track & field trio. I watch him jovially greet Mitsuzuri and the others. They seem to have met before.[lr]::
345::$$$message_0000_0086_0002$$$::Not only that, hearing Makidera yell "hey, it's the Red Guy!" is throwing me for a loop.::
346::$$$message_0000_0087_0000$$$::"Oh. Are you all acquainted already?[lr]::
347::$$$message_0000_0087_0001$$$::What a surprise. Saves us the trouble of introductions, though."[lr]::
348::$$$message_0000_0087_0002$$$::We hand out copies of the script, and make some half-assed introductions and casting assignments.::
349::$$$message_0000_0088_0000$$$::"...Hrm. I'm not questioning their character, but doesn't having all these outside people defeat the purpose of a school play?"[lr]::
350::$$$message_0000_0088_0001$$$::"Isn't this better, though? Without them, we'd each have to play multiple characters, and the main cast is still made up of Homurahara students.[lr]::
351::$$$message_0000_0088_0002$$$::If Saber and the others can fill in the minor roles, that'll let us focus more passion on our acting."::
352::$$$message_0000_0089_0000$$$::Mitsuzuri's always liked festivals, so she would be on board with Tohsaka's direction.[lr]::
353::$$$message_0000_0089_0001$$$::"Huh!? [cacheimage storage=蒔寺私服04c(近),蒔寺私服パンチ02c(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400]O-okay,[wvl canskip=0 time=400] you're saying...[wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服04c(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=200 storage=蒔寺私服パンチ02c(近) last=蒔寺私服04c(近) textoff=0][shock vmax=20 time=800 count=10]you mean, you want [font italic=true]me[font italic=false] as a main character!?"::
354::$$$message_0000_0090_0000$$$::And Makidera, who [font italic=true]loves[font italic=false] festivals, is making a huge fuss about the casting now, of all times.[lr]::
355::$$$message_0000_0090_0001$$$::She's evolved from the Monkey to the lead character. Later, history will remember this as Makidera's Rebellion.::
356::$$$message_0000_0091_0000$$$::   And so...[lr]::
357::$$$message_0000_0091_0001$$$::There was a jostling for play roles, and we all started memorizing the script and rehearsing for the cultural festival play.[lr]::
358::$$$message_0000_0091_0002$$$::The kyudo and track & field clubs will do a joint performance of a standard fairy tale.[lr]::
359::$$$message_0000_0091_0003$$$::It's a story of something that happened long ago, that everyone's heard at least once...::
360::$$$message_0000_0092_0000$$$::"Ahem. [wvs][shock vmax=20 time=200 count=2][wait canskip=0 time=300][move time=350 path=(310,182,180)(274,192,0) storage=020_溜息 accel=-2 spline=1 textoff=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
361::$$$message_0000_0092_0001$$$::Gather round. It's already been ten years since Momotarou and his three companions defeated the oni..."::
362::$$$message_0000_0093_0000$$$::"Momotarou lives a peaceful life with his grandparents, when news reaches his ears of the supposedly vanquished oni.[lr]::
363::$$$message_0000_0093_0001$$$::Rumors speak of oni coming back to life on the distant island of Onigashima. Unsettled by this revelation, Momotarou rises to the occasion once again.[lr]::
364::$$$message_0000_0093_0002$$$::Of course, we mustn't forget that he carried his grandmother's homemade millet dumplings!"::
365::$$$message_0000_0094_0000$$$::"The dumplings filled the mouth with a nostalgic flavor, but they also brought images of his admirable companions to mind.[lr]::
366::$$$message_0000_0094_0001$$$::What could they be doing right now, while he travels alone? [cacheimage storage=諸葛凛01a(中),諸葛凛01b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=諸葛凛01a(中) textoff=0]Right [wait canskip=0 time=100]no[wait canskip=0 time=200]w~[humming][lr]::
367::$$$message_0000_0094_0002$$$::Once, Momotarou traveled in search of three retainers, but now his adventure with the Five Tarous begins..."::
368::$$$message_0000_0095_0000$$$::"Hear ye, hear ye, distant listeners![lr]::
369::$$$message_0000_0095_0001$$$::And if ye be near, then see with your eyes![lr]::
370::$$$message_0000_0095_0002$$$::I am the famed Momotarou, known all across the land of Kibi!"::
371::$$$message_0000_0096_0000$$$::"Fiends of Onigashima![lr]::
372::$$$message_0000_0096_0001$$$::How insolent of you to return from the underworld! You still haven't learned your lesson![lr]::
373::$$$message_0000_0096_0002$$$::Whatever foul sorcery brought you back...[lr]::
374::$$$message_0000_0096_0003$$$::I, Momotarou, will root you out and purge Onigashima anew![lr]::
375::$$$message_0000_0096_0004$$$::Hip [shock vmax=10 time=200 count=2][wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=10 time=200 count=2]hip, [wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=10 time=300 count=8]hooray!!!"::
376::$$$message_0000_0097_0000$$$::"...[wait canskip=0 time=400]...[wait canskip=0 time=400]...[wait canskip=0 time=400]...[lr]::
377::$$$message_0000_0097_0001$$$::...Y'know, I think we could amp this up another notch.[lr]::
378::$$$message_0000_0097_0002$$$::I can't do anything on my own.[lr]::
379::$$$message_0000_0097_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服02c(遠) textoff=0][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=8][resumevoice]I'm so lonely![lr]::
380::$$$message_0000_0097_0004$$$::Oh, dear Dog! Monkey! Pheasant![lr]::
381::$$$message_0000_0097_0005$$$::Where could they be now? What are they up to?"::
382::$$$message_0000_0098_0000$$$::"Hear ye, hear ye. Is that the noble Momotarou I see?[lr]::
383::$$$message_0000_0098_0001$$$::We finally meet."[lr]::
384::$$$message_0000_0098_0002$$$::"...I am the Bear of Mount Ashigara![lr]::
385::$$$message_0000_0098_0003$$$::I come bear-ing tidings from my master!"[lr]::
386::$$$message_0000_0098_0004$$$::"Oh no, the puns are un-bearable!"::
387::$$$message_0000_0099_0000$$$::"Dear Lord Momotarou,[lr]::
388::$$$message_0000_0099_0001$$$::News of Onigashima's revival should have reached you by now.[lr]::
389::$$$message_0000_0099_0002$$$::The capital grows restless. Witnesses report monstrosities in the night, and the forces of darkness grow stronger.[lr]::
390::$$$message_0000_0099_0003$$$::We must answer Onigashima's malign influence.[lr]::
391::$$$message_0000_0099_0004$$$::The time has come to assemble all five Tarous and slay the fiends. We eagerly await your arrival.[lr]::
392::$$$message_0000_0099_0005$$$::                                                    Warm regards, Kintarou of Mount Ashigara."::
393::$$$message_0000_0100_0000$$$::"...That's all."[lr]::
394::$$$message_0000_0100_0001$$$::"They're [wait canskip=0 time=300]gathering...[wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=10 time=300 count=8]the Five Tarous!"[lr]::
395::$$$message_0000_0100_0002$$$::"I see now, Bear. You're Kintarou's messenger!"[lr]::
396::$$$message_0000_0100_0003$$$::"Bear-y astute."::
397::$$$message_0000_0101_0000$$$::"We will be waiting for you in the capital.[lr]::
398::$$$message_0000_0101_0001$$$::Please come as soon as you can."[lr]::
399::$$$message_0000_0101_0002$$$::"I'll set out right away.[lr]::
400::$$$message_0000_0101_0003$$$::Give my regards to Kintarou."::
401::$$$message_0000_0102_0000$$$::"It's true that I am no human. I was born from dragons."[lr]::
402::$$$message_0000_0102_0001$$$::"A dragon? Then, those are dragon horns!"[lr]::
403::$$$message_0000_0102_0002$$$::"...Haaah!"[lr]::
404::$$$message_0000_0102_0003$$$::"So strong!"[lr]::
405::$$$message_0000_0102_0004$$$::"My father is the White Dragon of the Mountain, and my mother is the Horned Dragon of the Lake.[lr]::
406::$$$message_0000_0102_0005$$$::They call me Ryuu-no-Kotarou[line len=2]dragon child."[stoplquake layer=all][lr]::
407::$$$message_0000_0102_0006$$$::"Ooh... Ryuu-no-Kotarou?[lr]::
408::$$$message_0000_0102_0007$$$::Are you a Tarou, too?[lr]::
409::$$$message_0000_0102_0008$$$::Not some kind of...oni?"::
410::$$$message_0000_0103_0000$$$::"All oni who menace the villagers are my enemies."[lr]::
411::$$$message_0000_0103_0001$$$::"Eeeep! I'm so sorry! [wait canskip=0 time=400][lr]::
412::$$$message_0000_0103_0002$$$::I'll apologize on my knees! [stoplquake layer=all][wvl canskip=0 time=400][wshock canskip=0][loopmove both=1 time=600 path=(524,208,255,1000)(515,222,255,1000)(524,208,255,1000)(552,239,255,1000)(524,208,255,1000) mover=RestiveMover storage=蒔寺私服02e(遠) accel=0 frame=1 decel=2 spline=1]Like this! SORRY! SO SORRY!"::
413::$$$message_0000_0104_0000$$$::"Thus did Momotarou meet his companion Ryuu-no-Kotarou and embark on a perilous journey.[lr]::
414::$$$message_0000_0104_0001$$$::But no matter where they went, they found no signs of Dog, Monkey, or Pheasant.[lr]::
415::$$$message_0000_0104_0002$$$::Momotarou was at his wits' end. "Then I will retake Onigashima on my own! I would rather die a thousand honorable deaths than stop here," he roared, but the calm and rational Ryuu-no-Kotarou calmed his passions."::
416::$$$message_0000_0105_0000$$$::"Wait! This is no fiend!"[lr]::
417::$$$message_0000_0105_0001$$$::"I am Momotarou of Kibi![lr]::
418::$$$message_0000_0105_0002$$$::I am the hero who will conquer Onigashima, and gain an audience with the Emperor himself!"[lr]::
419::$$$message_0000_0105_0003$$$::"Yeah, [font italic=true]sure[font italic=false] you will."[lr]::
420::$$$message_0000_0105_0004$$$::"This sarcasm...!"::
421::$$$message_0000_0106_0000$$$::"...Dog! It's you, Dog![wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=2] Dog![wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=2] Dog!"[lr]::
422::$$$message_0000_0106_0001$$$::"So the gatekeeper was Dog."[lr]::
423::$$$message_0000_0106_0002$$$::"You're doggone right,[wvl canskip=0 time=400] Dog![wvl canskip=0 time=400] Daw[wait canskip=0 time=100]w[wait canskip=0 time=100]w[wait canskip=0 time=100]g[wait canskip=0 time=100]!"[lr]::
424::$$$message_0000_0106_0003$$$::"Quit it already!"::
425::$$$message_0000_0107_0000$$$::"Nen nen kororiyo okororiyo~[humming][lr]::
426::$$$message_0000_0107_0001$$$::Tarou~ is a good boy~ Nen neshina~[humming][lr]::
427::$$$message_0000_0107_0002$$$::...Can't we cut this musical part out...grumble grumble..."[lr]::
428::$$$message_0000_0107_0003$$$::"My name is San'nen'netarou of Shinano![lr]::
429::$$$message_0000_0107_0004$$$::All I've done is sleep, but that's ancient history. Know that I married a beautiful woman and now serve the imperial court."::
430::$$$message_0000_0108_0000$$$::"Hold it, Momotarou. Dog is no longer part of your retinue.[lr]::
431::$$$message_0000_0108_0001$$$::How dare you show your face in the capital.[lr]::
432::$$$message_0000_0108_0002$$$::The Emperor is enraged."[lr]::
433::$$$message_0000_0108_0003$$$::"It isn't Momotarou's fault that the oni are back!"::
434::$$$message_0000_0109_0000$$$::"Be that as it may, he must clear his name.[lr]::
435::$$$message_0000_0109_0001$$$::If the oni he supposedly defeated have returned, [cacheimage storage=セイバー鎧20d(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー鎧20d(遠) textoff=0]one might think that his fanciful tales of adventure were meant to deceive the Emperor for his own gain."::
436::$$$message_0000_0110_0000$$$::"This is no time for bickering.[wvl][clfg time=400 storage=汗b textoff=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
437::$$$message_0000_0110_0001$$$::Our paths may differ, but are we not all fellow Tarous!?[wt canskip=0][stopmove][lr]::
438::$$$message_0000_0110_0002$$$::H-here [wvl canskip=0 time=300]goes..."[lr]::
439::$$$message_0000_0110_0003$$$::"Great [wvl canskip=0 time=150]axe [wvl canskip=0 time=150]on [wvl canskip=0 time=150]his [wvl canskip=0 time=150]shou[wvl canskip=0 time=150]l[wvl canskip=0 time=150]der[wvl canskip=0 time=150]s, [wvl canskip=0 time=150]Kin[wvl canskip=0 time=150]ta[wvl canskip=0 time=150]rou[wvl canskip=0 time=150]~[wait canskip=0 time=150][humming][wait canskip=0 time=150][lr]::
440::$$$message_0000_0110_0004$$$::legs [wvl canskip=0 time=150]a[wvl canskip=0 time=150]stride [wvl canskip=0 time=150]his [wvl canskip=0 time=150]trus[wvl canskip=0 time=150]ty [wvl canskip=0 time=150]steed, [wvl canskip=0 time=150]a [wvl canskip=0 time=150]horse, [wvl canskip=0 time=150]you [wvl canskip=0 time=150]ask? [wvl canskip=0 time=150]No, [wvl canskip=0 time=150]a [wvl canskip=0 time=150]bear[wait canskip=0 time=150]~[wait canskip=0 time=150][humming][wait canskip=0 time=150]"::
441::$$$message_0000_0111_0000$$$::"Hai-shi-doh-doh[humming]"[lr]::
442::$$$message_0000_0111_0001$$$::"Hai-doh-doh[humming]"[lr]::
443::$$$message_0000_0111_0002$$$::"Nowryah!"[lr]::
444::$$$message_0000_0111_0003$$$::"Lord Momotarou! Have you lost your bear-y mind!?[lr]::
445::$$$message_0000_0111_0004$$$::Take care where you swing your blade!"[lr]::
446::$$$message_0000_0111_0005$$$::"...I see Kintarous, no matter where I cut, though?"[lr]::
447::$$$message_0000_0111_0006$$$::"E-eek!"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
448::$$$message_0000_0111_0007$$$::"I will hold him back, so please continue the explanation."[lr]::
449::$$$message_0000_0111_0008$$$::"R-right..."::
450::$$$message_0000_0112_0000$$$::"It all began with a prophecy by the onmyouji Abe-no-Seimei: [lr]::
451::$$$message_0000_0112_0001$$$::Ominous stars rise in the northeast."[lr]::
452::$$$message_0000_0112_0002$$$::"Northeast...you mean toward Onigashima."[lr]::
453::$$$message_0000_0112_0003$$$::"Yes, Momotarou.[lr]::
454::$$$message_0000_0112_0004$$$::To make a long story short, Seimei said that the unprecedented evil coming from Onigashima will soon descend upon our land.[lr]::
455::$$$message_0000_0112_0005$$$::As you know, the oni grow strong in places beyond the protection of the monks and onmyouji."::
456::$$$message_0000_0113_0000$$$::"I've seen firsthand that the seal on Shuten-douji's grave is weakening. The tomb of the Tsuchigumo at Mount Katsuragi is in the same state.[lr]::
457::$$$message_0000_0113_0001$$$::I dread what this means.[lr]::
458::$$$message_0000_0113_0002$$$::Even the capital isn't safe if those monsters came back to life."::
459::$$$message_0000_0114_0000$$$::"Calamity threatens Japan!"::
460::$$$message_0000_0115_0000$$$::"The four Tarous[line len=2]Momotarou, Ryuu-no-Kotarou, Kintarou, and San'nen'netarou[line len=2]and their servants nominally agreed to set out to find the last Tarou, Urashima Tarou. [l][say storage=camp_00_rin_0200b name=凛]Ahh~ [wait canskip=0 time=1000][delay speed=100]I'm so hungry!"[delay speed=user]::
461::$$$message_0000_0116_0000$$$::I won't be needed for now, [se storage=se681.wav]so I slip out of the hall and go to the busy temple cookhouse.::
462::$$$message_0000_0117_0000$$$::There, I see dinner being prepared for fifteen.[lr]::
463::$$$message_0000_0117_0001$$$::"Here, eat up![lr]::
464::$$$message_0000_0117_0002$$$::Huh? You're here by yourself, Emiyan?"[lr]::
465::$$$message_0000_0117_0003$$$::"Neko?"::
466::$$$message_0000_0118_0000$$$::What a surprise.[lr]::
467::$$$message_0000_0118_0001$$$::I thought Reikan had come to spy on us again.[lr]::
468::$$$message_0000_0118_0002$$$::I didn't expect to see her at this mountain temple, of all places.[lr]::
469::$$$message_0000_0118_0003$$$::"Are you here delivering refreshments?"[lr]::
470::$$$message_0000_0118_0004$$$::"Yeah. They're paying me, though.[lr]::
471::$$$message_0000_0118_0005$$$::Here, put these in the fridge, [wvl][se storage=se503.wav]and these should go in the freezer. It should all fit in that massive walk-in they've got here."::
472::$$$message_0000_0119_0000$$$::"Oh, uh, thanks.[wvl canskip=0 time=200][se storage=se505.wav]Yup, [wvl canskip=0 time=200]yup, [wvl canskip=0 time=400][se storage=se502.wav]hup."[lr]::
473::$$$message_0000_0119_0001$$$::My body automatically moves according to Neko's orders. Just goes to show how used I am to working for her.::
474::$$$message_0000_0120_0000$$$::"Mm, good. That should do it.[lr]::
475::$$$message_0000_0120_0001$$$::Just two boxes left. Here's the car key, Emiyan.[lr]::
476::$$$message_0000_0120_0002$$$::Sorry, but I'm short on time. Evening service is about to start at Copenhagen."[lr]::
477::$$$message_0000_0120_0003$$$::"Oh, it is that time, now that you mention it."::
478::$$$message_0000_0121_0000$$$::"Yeah.[lr]::
479::$$$message_0000_0121_0001$$$::The customers will leave if there's only one person minding the place. That would make things easier for me, [wvl canskip=0 time=400]but whatever.[lr]::
480::$$$message_0000_0121_0002$$$::I need to have a talk with Rei[line len=2]I mean, the acting head monk, too."[lr]::
481::$$$message_0000_0121_0003$$$::She must mean Reikan.[lr]::
482::$$$message_0000_0121_0004$$$::Apparently, they know each other.::
483::$$$message_0000_0122_0000$$$::"So this key is for the minivan?"[lr]::
484::$$$message_0000_0122_0001$$$::"Yeah. It's parked downstairs.[lr]::
485::$$$message_0000_0122_0002$$$::Bring up the heavy things yourself. It's vegetables and rice and stuff.[lr]::
486::$$$message_0000_0122_0003$$$::There's two boxes, so it'll take two trips. [cacheimage storage=ネコ01a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=ネコ01a(中) textoff=0]Should I send the bill to the kyudo club?"[lr]::
487::$$$message_0000_0122_0004$$$::"Oh, I'll come settle it next time."[lr]::
488::$$$message_0000_0122_0005$$$::"Roger that!"::
489::$$$message_0000_0123_0000$$$::"Neko!"[lr]::
490::$$$message_0000_0123_0001$$$::Despite being on the way up with the heavy load, I spot Neko gently walking as I reach the top of the stairs.[lr]::
491::$$$message_0000_0123_0002$$$::"Thank you so much! We really appreciate it."[lr]::
492::$$$message_0000_0123_0003$$$::She gives me a casual "fuggedaboutit" without turning around. Yeah, she's pretty cool.::
493::$$$message_0000_0124_0000$$$::The autumn sun sets quickly, plunging Ryudou Temple into darkness, without any nearby streetlights to offset the murk.::
494::$$$message_0000_0125_0000$$$::[se storage=se540.wav]Enticing aromas begin to waft out of the cookhouse.[lr]::
495::$$$message_0000_0125_0001$$$::I hear a slight creaking of the floorboards, and then Saber appears.[sestop time=2000 nowait=1 storage=se540.wav]::
496::$$$message_0000_0126_0000$$$::"Shirou."[lr]::
497::$$$message_0000_0126_0001$$$::"Yeah, we're almost done. Should be another ten minutes."[lr]::
498::$$$message_0000_0126_0002$$$::"I haven't even said anything yet.[lr]::
499::$$$message_0000_0126_0003$$$::...[wait canskip=0 time=400]...[wait canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=400 storage=セイバー私服04c頬(遠)][wait canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=400 storage=セイバー私服05c(遠)][move time=180 path=(-30,153,255)(20,138,255)(40,155,255)(62,138,255)(75,155,255)(101,142,255)(120,155,255)(145,138,255) storage=セイバー私服05c(遠) accel=0 spline=1 textoff=0][say storage=camp_00_sav_0201 name=セイバー]But I will concede that these scents do whet my appetite."[wm canskip=0]::
500::$$$message_0000_0127_0000$$$::"Haha, sorry.[lr]::
501::$$$message_0000_0127_0001$$$::I'm getting hungry, too. I was getting worried I wouldn't be able to make enough."[lr]::
502::$$$message_0000_0127_0002$$$::"...Thank you for taking the time to cook for us.[lr]::
503::$$$message_0000_0127_0003$$$::Everyone else is taking turns in the bath, and they should be done shortly."::
504::$$$message_0000_0128_0000$$$::"Okay, good. I think I'll finish in time."[lr]::
505::$$$message_0000_0128_0001$$$::"Anyway...[lr]::
506::$$$message_0000_0128_0002$$$::Thanks to you too, Saber. It must've been hard."[lr]::
507::$$$message_0000_0128_0003$$$::Saber answers with a mild shake of her head.::
508::$$$message_0000_0129_0000$$$::"My part wasn't hard at all, compared to the others'.[lr]::
509::$$$message_0000_0129_0001$$$::I'd like to help you here if it isn't too much trouble."[lr]::
510::$$$message_0000_0129_0002$$$::"Thanks. In that case..."[lr]::
511::$$$message_0000_0129_0003$$$::Actually, there isn't much left to do.[lr]::
512::$$$message_0000_0129_0004$$$::About the only thing I'd like her to do is to spare some time to chat with me.::
513::$$$message_0000_0130_0000$$$::"...Okay, can I ask you to help with the plating?[lr]::
514::$$$message_0000_0130_0001$$$::There's a big bowl with salad on the middle shelf of the fridge. Go ahead and portion it out."[lr]::
515::$$$message_0000_0130_0002$$$::"Understood. Should I use one plate per person?"[lr]::
516::$$$message_0000_0130_0003$$$::"About ten is fine. There should be some wooden plates in that shelf.[lr]::
517::$$$message_0000_0130_0004$$$::We're going to do this family-style, so people can just grab whatever they want."::
518::$$$message_0000_0131_0000$$$::"I see. That sounds familiar enough."[lr]::
519::$$$message_0000_0131_0001$$$::We don't have any tongs, so Saber uses the serving chopsticks to efficiently portion out the salad. She wields them expertly.::
520::$$$message_0000_0132_0000$$$::I find myself staring at her side profile.[lr]::
521::$$$message_0000_0132_0001$$$::Maybe it's because this is a festive night, and not something we get to do often.[lr]::
522::$$$message_0000_0132_0002$$$::My heart's pounding and I can't stop it, just like the night we first met.[lr]::
523::$$$message_0000_0132_0003$$$::"Shirou."[lr]::
524::$$$message_0000_0132_0004$$$::"Huh...? [wvl canskip=0 time=200]Oh, [wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=25 time=300 count=3][se storage=se269.wav]crap."[lr]::
525::$$$message_0000_0132_0005$$$::I panic a little and return my attention to my cooking.::
526::$$$message_0000_0133_0000$$$::"There's something I feel I must tell you."[lr]::
527::$$$message_0000_0133_0001$$$::"Yeah? What's up?"::
528::$$$message_0000_0134_0000$$$::"I have never attended school like you. But today, I met several of your friends from school."[lr]::
529::$$$message_0000_0134_0001$$$::"Interesting bunch, right?"[lr]::
530::$$$message_0000_0134_0002$$$::"Yes. [wvl canskip=0 time=400]I have met Issei before, but now...[lr]::
531::$$$message_0000_0134_0003$$$::Ayako, Yukika, Kane...and Makiji. [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服05d(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服05d(中) textoff=0]Ah, no, it was Kaede, right?"[lr]::
532::$$$message_0000_0134_0004$$$::"Haha...yeah."::
533::$$$message_0000_0135_0000$$$::"They're a very pleasant group of people."[lr]::
534::$$$message_0000_0135_0001$$$::Saber whispers each of their names one more time, as if to carve them into her memory.[lr]::
535::$$$message_0000_0135_0002$$$::"Thank you, Shirou."[lr]::
536::$$$message_0000_0135_0003$$$::She ends with my name.::
537::$$$message_0000_0136_0000$$$::"I didn't do anything, though."[lr]::
538::$$$message_0000_0136_0001$$$::"No, this is all thanks to you.[lr]::
539::$$$message_0000_0136_0002$$$::Otherwise, I never would have had a chance to laugh with so many people."::
540::$$$message_0000_0137_0000$$$::"Well, then I should be thanking you, too.[lr]::
541::$$$message_0000_0137_0001$$$::I'm grateful for the help with rehearsal, of course, but I'm happy you changed your mind and came."[lr]::
542::$$$message_0000_0137_0002$$$::"I'm ashamed to say that I lost my temper this morning."::
543::$$$message_0000_0138_0000$$$::"But..."[lr]::
544::$$$message_0000_0138_0001$$$::A bitter smile crosses Saber's face, and she shrugs.[lr]::
545::$$$message_0000_0138_0002$$$::"I just can't get used to acting.[lr]::
546::$$$message_0000_0138_0003$$$::If I'm being honest, I'd like someone else to take over for me right away."[lr]::
547::$$$message_0000_0138_0004$$$::"Haha..."::
548::$$$message_0000_0139_0000$$$::It's getting noisy in the hallway. Makidera again?[lr]::
549::$$$message_0000_0139_0001$$$::The hungry bunch are about to arrive.[lr]::
550::$$$message_0000_0139_0002$$$::Good timing. I can ask them to set the table.::
551::$$$message_0000_0140_0000$$$::"Mm, Emiyan. The springtime of youth..."[lr]::
552::$$$message_0000_0140_0001$$$::"Though, I can't say eavesdropping is very admirable, Neko."[lr]::
553::$$$message_0000_0140_0002$$$::"Perish the thought. At least phrase it like we're watching over them.[lr]::
554::$$$message_0000_0140_0003$$$::I can't let that lazy, laissez-faire teacher be the only one to raise a young man with such a promising future."::
555::$$$message_0000_0141_0000$$$::"Great expectations can be a heavy burden, too.[lr]::
556::$$$message_0000_0141_0001$$$::In my eyes, Emiya is already an upstanding young man. In fact, the adults caring for him could learn a thing or two from his example."[lr]::
557::$$$message_0000_0141_0002$$$::"Fujimura relies too much on him.[lr]::
558::$$$message_0000_0141_0003$$$::Wait, are you talking about me, too?"[lr]::
559::$$$message_0000_0141_0004$$$::"Mm, I smell Shirou's curry!"::
560::$$$message_0000_0142_0000$$$::"Hi there, Fujimura the Third. Your nose is spot-on, but this is the service entrance."[lr]::
561::$$$message_0000_0142_0001$$$::"What the heck are you doing here!?"[lr]::
562::$$$message_0000_0142_0002$$$::"Ooh? Rei and Otoko?"[lr]::
563::$$$message_0000_0142_0003$$$::"Yeah, we came to check on them. Thought we'd give Shirou a hand."[lr]::
564::$$$message_0000_0142_0004$$$::"Ah, I see.[lr]::
565::$$$message_0000_0142_0005$$$::Thanks for doing that."::
566::$$$message_0000_0143_0000$$$::"...Good grief. You said you'd be handling the logistics. Are you slacking off already?"[lr]::
567::$$$message_0000_0143_0001$$$::"Aw, c'mon! I spent the whoooole day buried in paperwork, you know. I had to really rush to make it here in time for dinner!"[lr]::
568::$$$message_0000_0143_0002$$$::"Rush, eh?[lr]::
569::$$$message_0000_0143_0003$$$::I heard you're in charge of the students taking entrance exams."::
570::$$$message_0000_0144_0000$$$::"Yeah."[lr]::
571::$$$message_0000_0144_0001$$$::"Wow, I can't believe what I'm hearing. What's Homurahara coming to, asking [font italic=true]you[font italic=false] to handle that!?[lr]::
572::$$$message_0000_0144_0002$$$::It's our alma mater, y'know. You should pay attention to more than just dinner."::
573::$$$message_0000_0145_0000$$$::"Could you [font italic=true]be[font italic=false] any more rude!?[cacheimage storage=藤02d腕c(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=藤02d腕c(近)][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=2] Otoko, you should stop slacking and get back to your own shop. [wvl][se storage=se251.wav][shock vmax=20 time=250 count=2]Aren't you supposed to be serving customers now?"[shock vmax=20 time=250 count=2][lr]::
574::$$$message_0000_0145_0001$$$::"Yeah, yeah. It's about time. I was going to leave anyway, since just talking to you is tiring me out.[lr]::
575::$$$message_0000_0145_0002$$$::Also, don't call me Otoko in front of the others."[lr]::
576::$$$message_0000_0145_0003$$$::"I'll walk you out. The stairs are dark at this time of night."::
577::$$$message_0000_0146_0000$$$::"You honor me, brother monk.[lr]::
578::$$$message_0000_0146_0001$$$::Later, Fujimura."[lr]::
579::$$$message_0000_0146_0002$$$::"Bye![lr]::
580::$$$message_0000_0146_0003$$$::Thanks for the help, Neko."::
581::$$$message_0000_0147_0000$$$::"What a nuisance... How can they be so noisy in the middle of the night..."[lr]::
582::$$$message_0000_0147_0001$$$::"Matou asked me to critique the rehearsal tomorrow."[lr]::
583::$$$message_0000_0147_0002$$$::"...Eh?"::
584::$$$message_0000_0148_0000$$$::"I heard you were asked to play a minor part as well. Are you willing to?"[lr]::
585::$$$message_0000_0148_0001$$$::"W-well, it wouldn't do to nitpick the children's faults... So if you insist, Souichirou..."::
586::$$$message_0000_0149_0000$$$::It's October 11th.[lr]::
587::$$$message_0000_0149_0001$$$::The second day of the training camp is hectic.::
588::$$$message_0000_0150_0000$$$::We're practicing a weird play that's a fusion of [font italic=true]Momotarou[font italic=false] and [font italic=true]Kintarou,[font italic=false] two fairy tales that everyone knows.[lr]::
589::$$$message_0000_0150_0001$$$::We only have two days to rehearse.[lr]::
590::$$$message_0000_0150_0002$$$::Still, it feels like an oddly long time. My memory of it is filled with colorful episodes like Tohsaka's overbearing tyranny and Makidera's struggle to win the lead role.::
591::$$$message_0000_0151_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
592::$$$message_0000_0151_0001$$$::"The Five Tarous have gathered on the shores of Tango, pon. Now is the time to strike, pon."[lr]::
593::$$$message_0000_0151_0002$$$::"Enough of the pon-pons, Tanuki."[lr]::
594::$$$message_0000_0151_0003$$$::"P-pon-pon![lr]::
595::$$$message_0000_0151_0004$$$::It's too late to change that now, pon!"::
596::$$$message_0000_0152_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
597::$$$message_0000_0152_0001$$$::"Listen, Crane. This is vengeance.[lr]::
598::$$$message_0000_0152_0002$$$::Or do you want to repeat the mistakes of the past?"[lr]::
599::$$$message_0000_0152_0003$$$::"...I know.[lr]::
600::$$$message_0000_0152_0004$$$::Humans always break their promises."::
601::$$$message_0000_0153_0000$$$::"Raaabbit-rabbbit. Whatcha looking at[humming][lr]::
602::$$$message_0000_0153_0001$$$::The full moon is watching us, pyon[humming]"[lr]::
603::$$$message_0000_0153_0002$$$::"Do you really need to shake 'em like that!? You trying to sexually harass me!?"[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
604::$$$message_0000_0153_0003$$$::"N-no, I'm not shaking, I'm hopping, pyon!"::
605::$$$message_0000_0154_0000$$$::After dragging a bunch of Servants into it I was worried for a while how this would turn out, but we somehow managed to start wrapping up the rehearsal.[lr]::
606::$$$message_0000_0154_0001$$$::Thankfully, all of my work was behind-the-scenes, but I still managed to help out.::
607::$$$message_0000_0155_0000$$$::"...Momotarou.[lr]::
608::$$$message_0000_0155_0001$$$::You really shouldn't have returned to Onigashima."[lr]::
609::$$$message_0000_0155_0002$$$::"Momotarou, born from a peach.[lr]::
610::$$$message_0000_0155_0003$$$::You can no longer return to the human world.[lr]::
611::$$$message_0000_0155_0004$$$::No one knows your ultimate fate, nor should they want to!"::
612::$$$message_0000_0156_0000$$$::"I-I'm human! [cacheimage storage=蒔寺私服構え02a(中),蒔寺私服キック02b(中),蒔寺私服パンチ02b(中),139_波大][wvl][wm canskip=0][clfg time=10 storage=139_波大 textoff=0][chgfg time=100 storage=蒔寺私服構え02a(中) last=蒔寺私服04b(中) textoff=0][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=2][se storage=se721.wav][fg left=201 index=2000 top=271 time=10 storage=139_波大 opacity=0 textoff=0][move textoff=0 spread=1 mx=386 magnify=1 time=300 my=596 path=(386,440,255,1)(386,368,255,1.189)(386,401,255,1.411)(386,478,0,1.665) storage=139_波大 accel=-2]Sure, I was born from a peach, but that doesn't make me a peach! [wvl][wm canskip=0][clfg time=10 storage=139_波大 textoff=0][chgfg time=100 storage=蒔寺私服パンチ02b(中) last=蒔寺私服構え02a(中) textoff=0][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=2][se storage=se721.wav][fg left=201 index=2000 top=271 time=10 storage=139_波大 opacity=0 textoff=0][move textoff=0 spread=1 mx=386 magnify=1 time=300 my=596 path=(386,440,255,1)(386,368,255,1.189)(386,401,255,1.411)(386,478,0,1.665) storage=139_波大 accel=-2]At least get that part right! [wvl][wm canskip=0][clfg time=10 storage=139_波大 textoff=0][chgfg time=100 storage=蒔寺私服キック02b(中) last=蒔寺私服パンチ02b(中) textoff=0][shock vmax=40 time=600 count=8 textoff=0][se storage=se276.wav][fg left=201 index=2000 top=271 time=10 storage=139_波大 opacity=0 textoff=0][fg index=20000 pos=c time=10 storage=white opacity=0 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=0 top=0 time=1000 accel=0 storage=white textoff=0][move textoff=0 spread=1 mx=386 magnify=1 time=300 my=596 path=(386,440,255,1.5)(386,368,255,2)(386,401,255,2.5)(386,478,0,3) storage=139_波大 accel=-2]Don't discriminate against me!"::
613::$$$message_0000_0157_0000$$$::"Life would be much simpler if it were so easy to find oneself. Being lost is just part of living.[lr]::
614::$$$message_0000_0157_0001$$$::Momotarou, you didn't die on Onigashima.[lr]::
615::$$$message_0000_0157_0002$$$::I believe you were born here."::
616::$$$message_0000_0158_0000$$$::They push their way past the dense demonic aura,[lr]::
617::$$$message_0000_0158_0001$$$::finally arriving at the throne, where a lone oni awaits.[lr]::
618::$$$message_0000_0158_0002$$$::"You're here..."[lr]::
619::$$$message_0000_0158_0003$$$::With a languid voice, the oni lazily stands up.::
620::$$$message_0000_0159_0000$$$::"Y-[wvl][shock vmax=20 time=200 count=2]you're...[lr]::
621::$$$message_0000_0159_0001$$$::The Narrator!"[lr]::
622::$$$message_0000_0159_0002$$$::"So you were pulling the strings all along!"[lr]::
623::$$$message_0000_0159_0003$$$::"What? No. [cacheimage storage=凛制服コート06g(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服コート06g(中) textoff=0]Well, yes, but..."::
624::$$$message_0000_0160_0000$$$::"I am the Red Oni,[lr]::
625::$$$message_0000_0160_0001$$$::king of Onigashima.[lr]::
626::$$$message_0000_0160_0002$$$::Well met. You've kept me waiting, Momotarou."[lr]::
627::$$$message_0000_0160_0003$$$::"The Red Oni..."::
628::$$$message_0000_0161_0000$$$::"Look, [stopdash][cacheimage storage=凛制服コート15a腕b(中),o演劇09_鬼の城・近景-(真紅),028_アチャ矢b][wvl canskip=0 time=400][se storage=se120.wav][clfg][fg index=2000 pos=c storage=凛制服コート15a腕b(中)][fg index=1000 pos=c storage=o演劇09_鬼の城・近景-(真紅)][fg left=55 index=3000 top=35 storage=028_アチャ矢b opacity=0][dash textoff=0 page=back mx=143 opacity=180 layer=all irot=-0.0 cx=400 imag=2.8 time=800 cy=254 mag=2.8 my=0 rot=-0.0 accel=0][transex time=300][move textoff=0 opacity=255 base=028_アチャ矢b cx=345 layer=0 py=300 px=400 affine=(400,300,180,3,180,345,265) time=500 cy=265 mag=0.9 deg=+0.0 accel=0]you let your guard down. [cacheimage storage=凛制服コート15a腕b(中),071_white,o演劇09_鬼の城・近景-(真紅)][wvl][se storage=se121.wav]Gandr Shot."[wait canskip=0 time=200][quake time=3000 vmax=40 hmax=30][rep opacity=0,255 textoff=0 rule=koyama02r fliplr=0 tops=40,-52 storages=凛制服コート15a腕b(中),071_white time=200 flipud=0 lefts=201,-31 bg=o演劇09_鬼の城・近景-(真紅) indexes=1000,2000][stopquake][stopmove][stopdash][lr]::
629::$$$message_0000_0161_0001$$$::"Bwah!"::
630::$$$message_0000_0162_0000$$$::"...Gan[cacheimage storage=071_white][wvl][movefg opacity=255 left=-43 top=-58 time=50 accel=0 storage=071_white textoff=0][se storage=se124.wav][shock vmax=10 time=200 count=2][movefg opacity=0 left=-43 top=-58 time=100 accel=0 storage=071_white textoff=0][wm canskip=0]dr-dr-dr-[wvl][movefg opacity=255 left=-43 top=-58 time=50 accel=0 storage=071_white textoff=0][shock vmax=10 time=200 count=2][movefg opacity=0 left=-43 top=-58 time=100 accel=0 storage=071_white textoff=0][wm canskip=0]dr-dr-dr-[wvl][movefg opacity=255 left=-43 top=-58 time=50 accel=0 storage=071_white textoff=0][shock vmax=10 time=200 count=2][movefg opacity=0 left=-43 top=-58 time=100 accel=0 storage=071_white textoff=0][wm canskip=0]dr-dr-dr."[movefg opacity=255 left=-43 top=-58 time=50 accel=0 storage=071_white textoff=0][shock vmax=10 time=200 count=2][movefg opacity=0 left=-43 top=-58 time=100 accel=0 storage=071_white textoff=0][wm canskip=0][quake time=1000 vmax=20 hmax=10][fadein time=400 rule=円形(中から外へ) storage=white textoff=0 cleardash=1][stopdash][stopmove][stopquake][lr]::
631::$$$message_0000_0162_0001$$$::"Nnrgh!!!"::
632::$$$message_0000_0163_0000$$$::"Enough!"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
633::$$$message_0000_0163_0001$$$::With a wordless scream, Monkey jumps in front of the tormented Momotarou.[fadein time=400 storage=white textoff=0][stopdash][lr]::
634::$$$message_0000_0163_0002$$$::The oni's fell projectiles dash harmlessly against Monkey's shield.[lr]::
635::$$$message_0000_0163_0003$$$::The millet dumplings' divine might repels the Red Oni's [se storage=se133.wav]power.::
636::$$$message_0000_0164_0000$$$::"So weak...[lr]::
637::$$$message_0000_0164_0001$$$::Is this the 'hero' I feared?"[lr]::
638::$$$message_0000_0164_0002$$$::Annoyed, the Red Oni takes a step from the throne towards Momotarou.::
639::$$$message_0000_0165_0000$$$::"Kintarou!"[lr]::
640::$$$message_0000_0165_0001$$$::"I know!"[cacheimage storage=white,凛制服コート16d(中),凛制服コート16b(近),o演劇09_鬼の城・近景-(真紅)][wvs][wait canskip=0 time=600][fadein time=300 storage=white rule=走る感じ(右から) textoff=0][stopmove][stopdash][wait canskip=0 time=100][rep opacities=0,255 textoff=0 rule=走る感じ(右から) fliplr=0 tops=91, storages=凛制服コート16d(中),凛制服コート16b(近) time=300 flipud=0 lefts=519, poss=,c bg=o演劇09_鬼の城・近景-(真紅) indexes=1000,2000 cleardash=1][lr]::
641::$$$message_0000_0165_0002$$$::Kintarou charges the Red Oni.[lr]::
642::$$$message_0000_0165_0003$$$::The Red Oni evades it with a somersault.::
643::$$$message_0000_0166_0000$$$::"Kaidoumaru... Kintarou.[lr]::
644::$$$message_0000_0166_0001$$$::Your blade is no threat, but it doesn't belong in your hands."::
645::$$$message_0000_0167_0000$$$::"As long as I control the onilines of Onigashima, my power is endless. Gandr was just child's play."::
646::$$$message_0000_0168_0000$$$::"Now, by all means begin your oni hunt, Tarous.[lr]::
647::$$$message_0000_0168_0001$$$::I will show you ultimate tyranny. Let us decide once and for all[lr]::
648::$$$message_0000_0168_0002$$$::who the true oni is!"::
649::$$$message_0000_0169_0000$$$::Thus ends the long yet short play.[lr]::
650::$$$message_0000_0169_0001$$$::Despite the chaos, the judges[line len=2]Mr. Kuzuki, Fuji-nee, and Reikan[line len=2]all complimented it, and our rehearsal for the cultural festival drew to a close.[lr]::
651::$$$message_0000_0169_0002$$$::Then, we upheld the time-honored sports camp tradition of partying hard at the end.::
652::$$$message_0000_0170_0000$$$::It's nearly sunset.[lr]::
653::$$$message_0000_0170_0001$$$::We bring out a collection of soft drinks in every color of the rainbow, [se storage=se683.wav]Fuji-nee brings out her griddle for making okonomiyaki,[lr]::
654::$$$message_0000_0170_0002$$$::and the kyudo and track clubs drink and make merry, more or less improving their rapport.::
655::$$$message_0000_0171_0000$$$::As for those who never got along to begin with[line len=2][se storage=se561.wav]mainly Archer, Rider, and Caster[line len=2]they chat about the camp's events, begrudgingly as you'd expect.::
656::$$$message_0000_0172_0000$$$::However...[lr]::
657::$$$message_0000_0172_0001$$$::The party quickly devolves into chaos. Makidera and the Street Stall Guy[line len=2]she refuses to call him Lancer[line len=2]set up a carnival air gun stage, and Rider produces a massive amount of booze from the temple's hidden stocks. Finally, the student council president stands up.::
658::$$$message_0000_0173_0000$$$::"That's quite enough![lr]::
659::$$$message_0000_0173_0001$$$::Don't you drunkards know that you're on holy ground!?"[lr]::
660::$$$message_0000_0173_0002$$$::Correction: he explodes.::
661::$$$message_0000_0174_0000$$$::"See ya around. Give the girls my regards. [cacheimage storage=ランサー私服03c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg time=300 storage=ランサー私服03c(中) textoff=0]It ain't half bad reliving my childhood every now and then."[lr]::
662::$$$message_0000_0174_0001$$$::"Every now and then? Don't you mean every day?"[lr]::
663::$$$message_0000_0174_0002$$$::"Aw, get the stick outta your arse. [cacheimage storage=ランサー私服01b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=ランサー私服01b(中) textoff=0]Must be sad, living your life."[lr]::
664::$$$message_0000_0174_0003$$$::"Hmph. It's better than living without honor."::
665::$$$message_0000_0175_0000$$$::"I shall take my leave, as well.[lr]::
666::$$$message_0000_0175_0001$$$::I hope you all enjoy the rest of the evening."[lr]::
667::$$$message_0000_0175_0002$$$::"I feel bad about leaving Sakura and Ayako behind...[cacheimage storage=ライダー私服02e(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服02e(中) textoff=0]but I know better than to spoil a meeting between school friends..."::
668::$$$message_0000_0176_0000$$$::Each of the helpers return from whence they came.[lr]::
669::$$$message_0000_0176_0001$$$::As I watch them fade into the distance, I start to feel that this festival is truly over.[lr]::
670::$$$message_0000_0176_0002$$$::Sunset comes.[lr]::
671::$$$message_0000_0176_0003$$$::All that's left to do is an event to close out the camp.::
900075::$$$message_9000_0020_0000$$$::"Morning. Sorry I'm late."[r]���Q